<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-6 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-stretch">
        <aside class="w-full shrink-0 lg:w-52" aria-label="Хранилище">
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
                {% include 'vault/_vault_switcher.html.twig' with {
                    vault: vault,
                    vaults: vaults,
                    active_module_slug: active_module_slug|default(''),
                } %}
            </div>
        </aside>

        <div class="flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4">
            {% include 'vault/_breadcrumbs.html.twig' %}
            <div class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4">
                {% block vault_main %}{% endblock %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex min-h-11 shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 px-3 py-2 shadow-sm"
         style="background-color:#dc2626;color:#fff;line-height:1.4;font-size:12px;"
         role="region"
         aria-label="Нижняя панель">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);">Слои</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px]" style="color:#fff;" title="Порядок: бизнес-логика → шаблон → HTTP API → агенты">
                <span>Service</span>
                <span class="px-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                <span>Twig</span>
                <span class="px-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                <span>API</span>
                <span class="px-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                <span>MCP</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t pt-2" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);">План MCP</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[10px] leading-snug" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">resource_* — возможно объединим все эти методы</p>
            <ul class="mt-1 list-none font-mono text-[11px]" style="color:#fff;" aria-label="План MCP tools">
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> session_context_get</li>
                <li class="mt-1.5 pt-1.5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vaults_indexmap_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vaults_indexmap_rebuild</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vaults_list</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vault_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vault_create</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vault_update</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vault_exists</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vault_indexmap_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> vault_indexmap_rebuild</li>
                <li class="mt-1.5 pt-1.5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> sections_indexmap_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> sections_indexmap_rebuild</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> sections_list</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> section_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> section_create</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> section_update</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> section_delete</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> section_move</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> section_exists</li>
                <li class="mt-1.5 pt-1.5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> contents_indexmap_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> contents_indexmap_rebuild</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> contents_list</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_read</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_create</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_update</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_copy</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_rename</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_move</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_delete</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_upload</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_download</li>
                <li><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">[ ]</span> content_exists</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-2 border-t pt-2" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);">
                <p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);">Набор параметров (черновик)</p>
                <pre class="mt-1 max-w-full overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-[10px] leading-snug" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);">session_context_get → { workspace_id?, vault_slug?, disk_path? }

vault_*     vault_slug
            + поля manifest (name, description, …) на create/update

section_*   vault_slug, disk_path (узел: папка + manifest.*)
content_*   vault_slug, disk_path (файл в vault)
            + body | properties на write; upload/download — bytes, без YAML

list        vault_slug, parent_disk_path ('' = корень vault)
indexmap_read    vault_slug, index_disk_path (INDEX.md | …/index.md | …)
indexmap_rebuild те же параметры — пересборка оглавления (vault | section | slot/hub)

exists/read/update/delete/move/copy/rename
            vault_slug + disk_path — один каркас; kind: vault | section | content
            смотрим по пути (файл/папка) и acms-type в manifest

Объединить в 1 MCP-метод?
  • resource_read / resource_write / resource_exists / resource_move — да для узла+файла
  • resource_create — нет: vault (новая папка vaults/), section (mkdir),
    content (файл + frontmatter | upload) — разные ветки
  • vaults_list / vaults_indexmap_read — вне vault_slug (каталог хранилищ)</pre>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>